 $signed=Test-V3Pr515SignedCurrentNoCasCustody -Payload $SignedCurrentPayload -Cms $SignedCurrentCms -ReviewedCertSha256 $ReviewedSignerCertSha256 -CurrentOriginalFenceSha256 $ExpectedFenceSha256
